- Female  0.09 (q^2^)
- *0.3/0.09 = 3.33*

=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- For two alleles, p + q = 1.
- Expected genotype frequencies are p^2^, 2pq, and q^2^.
- Distinguish a genotype frequency from an allele frequency.
- Check the inheritance model before choosing an equation.

